graph LR
    A["vepyr-plugins repo<br/>&lt;plugin&gt;.source.toml @ tag"] --> B[git worktree<br/>at resolved SHA]
    S[Source file<br/>tsv / vcf / bed / parquet] --> V[md5 + index<br/>verification]
    B --> I["Ingest view<br/>(manifest ingest_sql)"]
    V --> I
    I --> N[Normalized view<br/>canonical_contig<br/>+ coordinate shift]
    N --> T[Tier join]
    C[Variation cache shard<br/>chrom, start, allele_string] --> T
    T --> O["plugin/&lt;name&gt;/chr*.parquet<br/>+ manifest.json"]
